# BIST_ELITE_CORE — PRDV3 Constitution

Follow **`docs/PRDV3_FINAL_GOD_ARCHITECTURE.md`** as the architecture constitution and acceptance authority for PRDV3 work.

## Non-negotiable

- Deterministic core trading and execution paths (no RNG in signals/fills).
- Fail-closed when data is missing, insufficient, or invalid.
- No silent fabrication of prices or masked source failures.
- BIST-only core product scope.
- Explainable decisions; audit-friendly structured output where implemented.
- PRDV2 substrate invariants (determinism, fail-closed, test-sealed modules) remain in force.

